      "name": "Travel Size Bug Repellent Stick",
      "description": "Granny Smith all natural bug repellent comes in a no-mess, long-lasting 0.35 oz tube. A little bit goes a long way! Made from just a few good, nourishing ingredients ~ all edible - which means it's safe for you, your children & your pets! Lemongrass, Peppermint & Rosemary essential oils are VERY EFFECTIVE in repelling ticks, fleas, mosquitos, spiders, lice & many more pests. A family friend tested our bug repellent stick on a group of boy scouts while restocking a fish pond . The report was quite impressive on its efficiency to ward off unwanted insects! Made in our home in Oregon - you can’t get any better than that!",
